  <p class="kicker">About</p>
  <h1 class="section-title">DNHS STEM Tesla Hub</h1>
  <p class="muted">Dangcagan National High School · Biology 2 · Class Study Hub · SY 2026–2027</p>

  <p>The Hub is the study resource hub for Tesla STEM Biology 2 — organized notes, practice quizzes you can repeat anytime, flashcards for quick review, and live tests hosted by your teacher, all in one place.</p>

  <h2>What's inside</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Notes</strong> — built from a templating engine so any unit or part can be added or edited with paragraphs, headings, bullets, numbered lists, images, dividers, and callouts. Existing content is just as easy to modify as adding new.</li>
    <li><strong>Practice & review</strong> — unlimited-retry practice quizzes with randomized items & options, flashcards with a flip animation, points, daily streaks, and weekly leaderboards.</li>
    <li><strong>Live tests</strong> — the teacher hosts a quiz and everyone answers in real time. Anti-cheat protections keep things fair.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Anti-cheat</h2>
  <p>During a live test, the system detects when a student switches tabs, blocks copy and right-click, and can require fullscreen. Items and options are randomized per student, so no two students see the same order. A configurable warning cap auto-removes a student who breaks the rules too many times.</p>

  <h2>Points & leaderboard</h2>
  <p>Points come from practice quizzes and flashcards — never from live tests. Daily streaks compound, and the weekly leaderboard resets every Monday so everyone has a fresh shot.</p>

  <h2>Tagline</h2>
  <p><em>Explore. Practice. Apply. Discover Biology.</em></p>

